# Zelf backend guidance

This repo now uses a layered guidance setup:

-   `AGENTS.md` for stable project facts and command summaries
-   `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` for always-on backend invariants
-   `.cursor/skills/*/SKILL.md` for deeper workflows and playbooks

## Keep these facts aligned

-   Public API docs use `https://v4.zelf.world`
-   Public API documentation belongs in `zelf-documentation/docs/api/`
-   Integration tests use a live backend and follow a strict no-mocking policy
-   Protected API tests should create a session first, then use `Authorization: Bearer <token>` and `Origin: https://test.example.com`
-   Route registration happens through `Routes/unprotected-repositories.js` and `Routes/protected-repositories.js`

## Port guidance

-   `Core/config.js` falls back to `3000`
-   `.env.example` sets `PORT=3003`
-   Some older tests still fall back to `3000` or `3050`

Prefer running the backend and tests with an explicit `PORT` instead of relying on fallback values.

## Deep guidance

-   Runbook: `.cursor/skills/backend-agent-runbook/SKILL.md`
-   Architecture patterns: `.cursor/skills/backend-patterns/SKILL.md`
-   Feature scaffolding: `.cursor/skills/add-repository-feature/SKILL.md`
-   Integration tests: `.cursor/skills/integration-test-playbook/SKILL.md`
